    "overview": "<p>Conventional infantry within the DCMS serve as the foundation of planetary defense, providing the manpower essential to territorial control while freeing BattleMech and armored assets for offensive operations. The platoon's field gun is a heavy ultra autocannon capable of firing at twice the normal rate. The burst of heavy-caliber shells can stagger BattleMechs and cripple vehicles in seconds, though the mechanism risks jamming if pushed too hard.</p>"
